1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:02,860
(Sheldon:)Good morning, Amy.

2
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:08,970
(Amy:)It most assuredly is not.

3
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:12,400
(Sheldon:)Are you experiencing
dehydration, headache,

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,570
(Sheldon:)nausea and shame?

5
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:17,240
(Sheldon:)Yes.

6
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,510
(Amy:)I also found a Korean man's
business card

7
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:21,910
(Amy:)tucked into my cleavage.

8
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:24,210
(Amy:)What happened last night?

9
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,120
Ah, memory impairment;

10
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:30,720
(Sheldon:)the free prize at the bottom
of every vodka bottle.

11
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:31,860
(Amy:)Sheldon?

12
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:32,990
(Priya:)All right.

13
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:36,590
(Sheldon:)Last night you gave me
some excellent advice

14
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:37,960
(Sheldon:)regarding my problem here
at home,

15
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:42,400
(Sheldon:)you kissed me and then vomited
on and off for 40 minutes,

16
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:46,200
(Sheldon:)following which you passed out
on your bathroom floor.

17
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:49,310
(Sheldon:)I then folded a towel under
your head as a pillow,

18
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:51,240
(Sheldon:)set your oven clock
to the correct time

19
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:53,710
(Sheldon:)because it was
driving me crazy...

20
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:56,210
(Sheldon:)...and I left.

21
00:00:56,210 --> 00:00:59,380
(Penny:)Okay.

22
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:02,990
(Amy:)Don't really know
where we go from here.

23
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:05,660
(Sheldon:)I suggest
we treat our relationship

24
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:07,820
(Sheldon:)as if it were
a crashed computer

25
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:11,430
(Sheldon:)and restore it to the last point
we both agree it worked.

26
00:01:11,430 --> 00:01:13,800
(Amy:)Terrific. Thank you.

27
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:17,100
(Amy:)They were out of menthols!

28
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,900
(Amy:)Get off my back!

29
00:01:22,110 --> 00:01:25,240
(Amy:)Not easy living with a
temperamental little primate.

30
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:27,680
(Leonard(off):)Come on, Priya,
just admit I embarrass you!

31
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,030
(Sheldon:)You're preaching
to the choir, sister.

